        <fields>
            <name>Payload_Text</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;DEMO ARCHITECTURE - simulated SAP handoff.&lt;/b&gt; No live SAP connection. In production this payload goes through middleware (MuleSoft / SAP Integration Suite) to SAP, and the sales order number, status and invoice come back to this Order. The sales team never enters anything in SAP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Order &lt;b&gt;{!Get_Order.OrderNumber}&lt;/b&gt; for &lt;b&gt;{!Get_Order.Account.Name}&lt;/b&gt;, PO {!Get_Order.PoNumber}, total {!Get_Order.TotalAmount}.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
